    "classification": "The 34520 leaf identifies sulfur with explicit exceptions for sublimed, precipitated and colloidal sulfur. Recovered elemental sulfur first accepted in liquid bulk fits its positive scope. The receiver and actual physical state are required to establish the narrower association. A classification or substance name cannot establish an identical native product or provider record.",
