    "readiness": "Candidate methodology. Provider data, measured site input and receiving lot, native identities and independently qualified sampling conditions are study evidence. Scientific approval, formal translation review and publication have their own gates. Foreground methods still need to qualify product purity and moisture, the complete supplier input analysis and separation of vapor from particulate releases. Sixteen specific exchange identities remain unbound.",
